---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

export const prerender = true;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="The terms that govern your use of the MyGameDNA website and its classification tools."
  canonicalPath="/terms-of-use"
>
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <article class="max-w-none space-y-6 text-(--color-text)">
      <header class="border-b border-(--color-border) pb-6">
        <h1
          class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-(--color-text) sm:text-4xl"
        >
          Terms of Use
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted">Last updated: 14 September 2026</p>
      </header>

      <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Welcome to MyGameDNA. These terms govern your use of the website and its
        classification tools, questionnaire, catalogue, rankings, and profile
        features. By using the service, you agree to them. If you do not agree,
        please do not use the service.
      </p>

      <h2
        class="border-t border-(--color-border) pt-6 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-(--color-text)"
      >
        1. Eligibility and your account
      </h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-relaxed text-muted">
        <li>
          You must be legally able to enter into these terms and old enough to
          use the service where you live.
        </li>
        <li>
          You are responsible for your account and for keeping your password
          confidential, and for activity that happens under your account.
        </li>
        <li>
          Provide accurate information and keep it up to date. Do not share your
          account or let someone else use it to evade a moderation decision.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2
        class="border-t border-(--color-border) pt-6 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-(--color-text)"
      >
        2. Acceptable use
      </h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted">You agree not to:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-relaxed text-muted">
        <li>harass, threaten, or abuse other users;</li>
        <li>impersonate another person or misrepresent your affiliation;</li>
        <li>
          scrape, crawl, or bulk-download the service or its data outside normal
          browsing;
        </li>
        <li>
          use bots or automated tooling to submit content or scores, or to
          create accounts;
        </li>
        <li>
          attempt to circumvent moderation, rate limits, or other technical
          controls;
        </li>
        <li>
          attempt to access accounts or data you do not have permission to
          access; or
        </li>
        <li>use the service for anything unlawful.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2
        class="border-t border-(--color-border) pt-6 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-(--color-text)"
      >
        3. Classifications are editorial estimates
      </h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted">
        The Challenge and Reward profiles, scores, and rankings are opinionated
        editorial estimates produced from a combination of expert assessment and
        player submissions. They are not objective facts or professional advice,
        and they will change as more data arrives. Do not rely on them for
        purchasing or other important decisions.
      </p>

      <h2
        class="border-t border-(--color-border) pt-6 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-(--color-text)"
      >
        4. Your content
      </h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted">
        You keep ownership of the content you post, such as your profile text,
        questionnaire answers, scores, and reports. By posting it, you grant us
        a limited, non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free licence to store,
        reproduce, display, and distribute that content as part of operating and
        promoting the service. This licence ends when you delete the content or
        your account, except where we need to keep copies for legal or
        moderation reasons. You confirm that you have the right to post what you
        post.
      </p>

      <h2
        class="border-t border-(--color-border) pt-6 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-(--color-text)"
      >
        5. Content and moderation
      </h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-relaxed text-muted">
        <li>You can report content or users that break these terms.</li>
        <li>
          We review reports and may remove content, restrict features, or
          suspend or delete accounts.
        </li>
        <li>
          Where we identify a problem, we may require you to correct or remove
          content before you can continue using certain features, for example by
          routing you through a remediation step.
        </li>
        <li>
          Moderation decisions are ours to make, and we may act on content that
          harms the community even if it is not listed above.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2
        class="border-t border-(--color-border) pt-6 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-(--color-text)"
      >
        6. Availability
      </h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted">
        MyGameDNA is a free service provided &ldquo;as is&rdquo; and &ldquo;as
        available.&rdquo; We do not warrant that it will be uninterrupted or
        error-free, or that classifications are accurate or complete. We may
        change, suspend, or discontinue any part of the service at any time.
      </p>

      <h2
        class="border-t border-(--color-border) pt-6 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-(--color-text)"
      >
        7. Limitation of liability
      </h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted">
        To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any
        indirect, incidental, or consequential loss arising from your use of the
        service, including loss of data or reliance on a classification. Nothing
        in these terms excludes liability that cannot be excluded by law.
      </p>

      <h2
        class="border-t border-(--color-border) pt-6 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-(--color-text)"
      >
        8. Intellectual property
      </h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Game titles, artwork, screenshots, and logos belong to their respective
        owners. We use them descriptively to identify the games being
        classified, and MyGameDNA is not affiliated with or endorsed by those
        owners. The MyGameDNA name, site design, and original text are ours.
      </p>

      <h2
        class="border-t border-(--color-border) pt-6 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-(--color-text)"
      >
        9. Governing law
      </h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted">
        These terms are governed by the laws of Malaysia, and disputes are
        subject to the jurisdiction of the Malaysian courts.
      </p>

      <h2
        class="border-t border-(--color-border) pt-6 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-(--color-text)"
      >
        10. Changes to these terms
      </h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted">
        We may update these terms. If we make material changes, we will update
        the &ldquo;Last updated&rdquo; date at the top of this page and, where
        appropriate, provide additional notice. Continuing to use the service
        after a change means you accept the updated terms.
      </p>

      <h2
        class="border-t border-(--color-border) pt-6 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-(--color-text)"
      >
        11. Contact
      </h2>
      <p class="leading-relaxed text-muted">
        Questions about these terms: alerts@gamedna.my.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
